<%#
# SimpleMarkdown Form Partial

Renders a textarea that the bundled JavaScript upgrades into an EasyMDE editor.

There is no inline script: the editor is found by its data attribute, which
means it needs no unique element id, survives Turbo navigation, and adds no
requirement for `unsafe-inline` or `unsafe-eval` in a Content-Security-Policy.

## Local variables:

- `f`:
  A Rails form generator, used to help create the appropriate input fields.
- `field`:
  An instance of Administrate::Field::SimpleMarkdown.
%>

<div class="field-unit__label">
  <%= f.label field.attribute %>
</div>
<div class="field-unit__field simple_markdown simple-markdown">
  <%= f.text_area field.attribute, field.input_options %>
</div>
